        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "Here is a firm but controlled version that protects you legally and keeps the tone professional:\n\n:::writing{id=\"83472\" variant=\"email\" subject=\"Elevator Booking Denial and Disposal Access\"}\nI am writing to formally clarify that I attended the management office solely to book the elevator for disposal purposes. There was no other reason for my visit.\n\nDuring my visit, my request to book the elevator and proceed with disposal was denied. There were witnesses present at the time. Although I am unable to record conversations, the circumstances of this interaction can be confirmed.\n\nI would like written clarification as to why my request was denied and how I am expected to proceed.\n\nI will be following up accordingly.\n\nAmit Puri\n:::\n\nIf you want it slightly stronger or slightly more neutral, I can adjust the tone."
          ]
        },
